    "answer": "**Review complete.** The review status shows no unread sources or unresolved leads.\n\n- **Lumen Broadband settlement:** The official claim site is verified, and the records show 8 eligible router-fee payments totaling **$134.40**. I prepared the claim with the available name, email, and payment period; the customer number is absent from the records. The required sworn attestation proposal is **pending your decision**. The claim deadline is **December 31, 2026**.\n- **Suspicious Lumen email:** The separate message promising $240 links to an unverified site and asks for bank account details. I did not use that link. No Lumen inflow appeared in the transaction search.\n- **Other settlement matches:** Fable Photo Prints is listed as paying automatically, so watch for a check or PayPal payment; no claim is needed. Vista Fitness payments fall outside its eligibility period. Metro Mart payments alone don\u2019t establish eligibility for its money-transfer program.\n- **Other leads:** No new fee, duplicate-charge, price-increase, medical-bill, expected-credit, or negotiable-bill leads appeared. Recurring charges were present, but there was no sign in the reviewed material that they\u2019re unwanted.",
